<title>POLAND: Olawa shareholders pass 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Olawa shareholders pass 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish non-ferrous metals smelter Huta Olawa SA have voted to put last year's 1.6-million-zloty net profit into reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
